d  because you do you learn a lot of skills  you take home a lot you know have fun be  yourself be confident and just go in  there with a set in your mind that  everything you touch will turn to gold  and you've got this  and i promise you when you stick with  that mantra you will always win you will  always win my mom's been telling me that  since i was a little girl and look where  i am now wow what a note to end on i  feel like i need that tattooed somewhere  don't know where  i'm gonna get it here  um honestly jasmine what an amazing note  to end on um i feel so inspired um it's  been so so great speaking with you um  and wish you all the best where are we  gonna see you next what are you up to  next cannot say i'm afraid the only  thing that i can say is keep your eyes  peeled for naughts and crosses too  jasmine it's been a pleasure thank you  so much and thanks to all of you guys  for watching i hope you enjoyed it and  from both of us we're wishing you all  the best of your creative careers thanks  everyone bye  yes god bless

